      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAXIMUM DAMAGE (1) has a strong overall record having 12 wins and 18 places from 44 starts but was out of the money last time when fifth (26.16) over 457m at Temora. Solid record here at the distance winning three races. Has the inside draw and looks tough to beat. PAW YARRA (2) missed the hat-trick last start when second and beaten 3.5 lengths (23.31) last time at this track. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Can feature again. KIWI JAY (3) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when sixth at this track over 400m behind Paw Lilibet (23.51) in a Grade 5. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. In the mix. GRAPEFRUIT YAEKO (6) is a last start winner and can go on with it.",
